{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはハーフアップ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日撮影終わりだったから\n髪の毛巻いてたのに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲリラ豪雨に遭いまして\nストレートになりました( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなぴよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"湿気に弱い髪の毛なの( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！ChihAnswer！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日募集するの忘れちゃってた( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね( ;o; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので今日は\n昨日送ってくれた方と、\n今まで送ってくれた方にも\n質問返しさせていただきます :-)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アストンヴィラあつひこさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・リオ五輪、ちーちゃんが出るとしたらどれにでたい？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→競歩...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でももし能力が急に備わったら\n体操に出てみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に床に出たい！\nくるくる飛んでみたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"yuさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんがカラオケでよく歌うのは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→「残酷な天使のテーゼ」\n「赤いスイートピー」\n「M」\n「ひまわりの約束」\n「初恋サイダー」\n「ムーンライト伝説」\n「気まぐれロマンティック」\n「フレンズ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかかな♡\n十八番たちです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にっとんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・牛タンはやっぱり塩で食べる派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→塩！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはわさびと一味をちょっとづつ足して\n辛味を出すよ〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近一味や七味も好きになってきたの。\n大人...(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"708⊿さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんはライブでどんな時にテンションが上がりますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→客席にいる皆さんが私達を見て\n感動したり、驚いたり、\n喜んだり、楽しそうにしているのが見えると\nとても嬉しくなります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが思ってるより\n見えてるんだよ〜♪？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとファンの方と目が合ったり\n私に向かって手を振ってくれたり\n赤と青のサイリウムを振ってくれたり\nタオルや団扇を持っててくれたり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくれている方がいる事を\n身をもって感じられる瞬間が\nテンションがあがります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のんのんさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・ちーちゃんオススメのブランドは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→・Lily Brown\n・snidel\n・REDEAZEL\n・ZARA\n・JEANASIS\n・MULLER\n・DAMMY"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"をよく着るかな( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひまひさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・日本食や中華、イタリアンやエスニックなど色んなジャンルの食べ物がありますが、何が好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→やっぱり日本人として日本食は\n大好きです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもたまに食べたくなるのは\nエスニック料理！\nパクチーが大好き！\nどんな料理も大盛りにしたいくらい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いおりさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・勉強中に音楽を聴く派ですか？聴かない派ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→聴かない派です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音楽が流れていると\n私はあまり集中できなくなる(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも教科ごとにこの曲を聴く！\nっていうのを決めて勉強して、\nその教科のテスト直前にその曲を聴くと\n脳が音楽につられて\n勉強したことを直ぐに\n思い出しやすくなるらしいっていうのを\n風の噂で聞いたことある...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(違ったらごめんね...)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週こそちゃんと質問募集するね(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしい写真見つけた(_ _).｡o♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10thカップリング曲の\n「私、起きる。」のMV撮影の時！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時みんな高校生だよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時が経つのは早い(> <)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生の私達も...どう？(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「All Star」Smash Mouthさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな映画、\nシュレックの冒頭の曲！\nこの曲を聴くと映画が始まる\nワクワク感と、\nハッピーな気分を得られる。\n本当シュレック大好きなんだ〜\n映画何回観てもドキドキする。\n浜田さんのシュレックと\n山寺さんのドンキーと\n藤原紀香さんのフィオナの声が\nぴったりすぎるとの\n豪華すぎて...！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/17/6029225/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紅白のとき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黒髪だ〜( ˙³˙)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何故か今日は昔の写真を載せたい気分みたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにはね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台風にはくれぐれも。\n皆さんお気を付けて。(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}